/* =============================================================================
   scrOverview -> OnVisible   (screen property: paste into the formula bar)

   ACCESS (change request 23.09.26): admins see everyone, line managers see
   only their reportees, nobody else gets in. varIsAdmin comes from OnStart
   (People.IsAdmin). varIsLineManager is worked out HERE, not in OnStart, so
   that a missing or misnamed LineManagerEmail column can only break the admin
   screens - in OnStart it would take the whole app down (see section 4b).
   Anyone who is neither is sent straight back to the landing page.

   The data build itself lives in btnRefreshOverview.OnSelect (and, identically,
   in btnRefreshSubs.OnSelect on scrSubmissions). Select() runs it, so a visit
   and a press of "Refresh data" do exactly the same thing. A copy of that
   formula is in paste/admin-rebuild.powerfx.
   ============================================================================ */
Set(varIsLineManager, Not IsBlank(LookUp('RolePreference People', LineManagerEmail = varUserEmail).EmployeeID));
If(
    varIsAdmin Or varIsLineManager,
    Set(varStaffTab, Coalesce(varStaffTab, "All"));
    Select(btnRefreshOverview),
    Navigate(scrLanding);
    Notify("The admin pages are only available to Aurora admins and line managers.", NotificationType.Error)
)
